  m_text: "\u2022 A real non-metal has a base colour between 50 (coal) and 243 (snow).\n\u2022 Man-made blacks reach 32. Avoid darker values.\n\u2022 128 is the grey card used in photography to set exposure.\n\u2022 A metal has a bright base colour: the colour of its reflection.\n\u2022 Front row: rough. Back row: smooth.\n\n<size=75%><color=#A0A0A0>Values: Unity, HDRP Material Samples</color></size>"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
