      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "\u2022 Base colour and metallic are measured: look them up.\n\u2022 Smoothness is the finish of the surface: choose it.\n\u2022 Polished and wet versions keep the colour and only change the smoothness.\n\u2022 A real wet surface also becomes darker.\n\u2022 Labels: base colour (sRGB) \xB7 metallic \xB7 smoothness.\n\n<size=75%><color=#A0A0A0>Base colours: Physically Based (physicallybased.info), CC0</color></size>"
